Scott: But unlike those other late shows, it's actually recorded at night.

946
01:02:36,060 --> 01:02:50,200
Rym: And the Patreon patrons for this episode of GeekNights are Ellen Joyce, Linki G, Jared, Liz, Annabelle Case, Cara Makes, Musa Chris, The Doc Chris, Clinton, Walton, Finn, Joel Hayes, Penny, Rymer, Rebecca Dunn, Sam Erickson, Shervin, Von Harl, and a bunch of people whose names I will not say.

947
01:02:50,802 --> 01:03:50,500
Rym: The moral of this episode is to not buy AMD and now tonight I simply leave you with... [MUSIC] [MUSIC].

